    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="0811" n="789" xml:id="pg789"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to the online version of <ref
                        target="frus:frus1961-63v16">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1961–1963, Volume XVI,
                        Eastern Europe; Cyprus; Greece; Turkey</ref>. Please be aware that printed
                    volumes have not been revised. Revised information is in italic.</p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d115-f2">Footnote 1, Document
                                115</ref>. Page 250.</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The revised footnote reads: “1. <hi rendition="#italic">In November 1961,
                            West German authorities arrested Yugoslav businessman L. Varcaric in
                            Munich for the killing of two German soldiers during World War II. Less
                            than a week later, Varcaric was released amidst protests from the
                            Yugoslav government.</hi>”</item>
                    <item>Footnote 1 originally read: “1. On November 11, 1961, Yugoslav authorities
                        arrested a West German businessman, L. Vracaric, and charged him with war
                        crimes. Following protests from the West German Government, he was
                        released.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
